@baseUrl = https://localhost:7122

### Verify setup — list all animals (seed data: IDs 1-5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/animals

###

### Verify setup — list all robots (IDs 1-3 active, ID 4 inactive)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/robots

###

# ─── Happy path ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Record a milking for Bella (animal 1) by Robot-A1 (robot 1)
### Expected: 201 Created  { "id": <new_id> }
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/milkings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "animalId": 1,
  "robotId": 1,
  "milkYieldLiters": 28.5,
  "duration": 420
}

###

### Verify the event was saved
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/milkings/animal/1/last

###

# ─── Double-milking protection ────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Milk Bella again immediately — she was just milked
### Expected: 409 Conflict  { "error": "Animal was milked too recently", "lastMilkedAt": ..., "nextAllowedAt": ... }
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/milkings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "animalId": 1,
  "robotId": 2,
  "milkYieldLiters": 24.0
}

###

# ─── Validation failures ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Zero milk yield — caught by [Range] data annotation before hitting the service
### Expected: 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/milkings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "animalId": 2,
  "robotId": 1,
  "milkYieldLiters": 0
}

###

### AnimalId = 0 — caught by [Range(1, int.MaxValue)] annotation
### Expected: 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/milkings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "animalId": 0,
  "robotId": 1,
  "milkYieldLiters": 25.0
}

###

# ─── Business rule failures ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Animal does not exist
### Expected: 404 Not Found  { "error": "Animal not found" }
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/milkings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "animalId": 99999,
  "robotId": 1,
  "milkYieldLiters": 25.0
}

###

### Robot does not exist
### Expected: 404 Not Found  { "error": "Robot not found" }
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/milkings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "animalId": 2,
  "robotId": 99999,
  "milkYieldLiters": 25.0
}

###

### Robot-B2 (robot 4) is inactive — seed data sets IsActive = 0
### Expected: 422 Unprocessable Entity  { "error": "Robot is not active" }
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/milkings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "animalId": 2,
  "robotId": 4,
  "milkYieldLiters": 25.0
}

###

# ─── Recent milkings ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### All milking events from the last 24 hours (should include the one we just created)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/milkings/recent?hours=24
